    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Ready to shape the products of tomorrow? <strong>The Product Challenge</strong>&nbsp;is the ultimate product design and innovation challenge where you step into the role of a Product Manager to architect the next big tech solution!</p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines :&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2\">\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"2,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Solve a Massive Industry Challenge:</strong> Take on real-world market friction, identify key consumer trends, and build a tech-first solution that redefines user convenience and digital trade</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,0,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Define Your Vision:</strong> Identify a high-impact target segment, map out the core problem, and pitch a game-changing product concept</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Craft the User Experience:</strong> Design seamless end-to-end user journeys and create stunning UX/UI mockups or wireframes that bring your product to life</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Build the Tech &amp; Business Blueprint:</strong> Lay out the tech stack (AI, IoT, or automated systems) powering your platform and construct a viable, profitable monetization strategy</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"2,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Showcase Scalability &amp; Impact:</strong> Prove technical feasibility, data privacy, and outline key performance metrics (KPIs) to show how your innovation scales globally</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,4,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Pitch Your Big Idea:</strong> Package your vision into an executive <strong data-path-to-node=\"2,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">8-slide pitch deck</strong> to battle it out on the national stage</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5,0,2\">!</span></li>\n<li>Platform will be unstop and offline event at IIT Kanpur.</li>\n</ul>",
